{"seq":3,"slug":"investor-qualification-beneficial-owner-review","title":"投资者资质审查与实益所有人穿透识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/zone-regime-investor-admission-model/investor-qualification-beneficial-owner-review","wordCount":2955,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"投资者资质审查与实益所有人穿透识别\">投资者资质审查与实益所有人穿透识别</h1><p>一家在开曼注册的控股公司申请入驻某自由贸易试验区，股东名册显示其 100% 由另一家开曼实体持有，后者又由一家 BVI 公司与一只开曼基金共同持有。园区招商部门看到三层离岸结构后仍找不到&quot;人&quot;。真正决定这宗投资能否放行的，不是最上层申报主体是谁，而是<strong>穿透到最终控制实体之后，那个人是否落在负面清单、制裁名单或外资准入限制之内</strong>。这就是准入审查的核心：把&quot;名义投资者&quot;与&quot;实益所有人（Beneficial Owner, BO）&quot;分开做可核验的身份与控制权认定。</p>\n<p>制度底座（各类特区的法律形态与准入框架）见同章 <a href=\"sez-ftz-bonded-zone-regime-taxonomy\">特区、自贸区与保税区制度分类</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-准入审查的两层结构\">核心概念：准入审查的两层结构</h2><p>投资者准入（investor admission）在制度上被拆成<strong>形式层</strong>与<strong>实质层</strong>。形式层审查申报主体的法律存在与经营资质：注册证、存续证明、章程、审计报告、行业许可。实质层审查&quot;站在申报主体背后的人&quot;，即穿透后的实益所有人。两者缺一不可——只看形式层，空壳公司即可满足全部文件要求；只看实质层，则无法确认签字主体有无法律能力承担义务。</p>\n<p>特区/自贸区尤其强调实质层，因为园区激励本身就是<strong>可被滥用的经济资源</strong>，若不识别真实控制人，激励可能流向被制裁主体或成为洗钱通道。FATF 在 2014 年《法人实益所有权透明度指引》中把&quot;识别并核实实益所有人&quot;列为主管机关强制义务，并于 2023—2025 年修订中要求各国建立<strong>集中的实益所有权登记</strong>或等效机制，使主管机关能在不依赖申报主体配合的情况下取得 BO 信息（<a href=\"https://www.fatf-gafi.org/en/topics/beneficial-ownership.html\">FATF Recommendation 24 及其修订</a>）。</p>\n<p>实益所有人的通用判定遵循&quot;<strong>控制 + 利益</strong>&quot;双通道：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>Own</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext> Ctrl</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>true</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BO \\in \\{u \\mid \\text{Own}(u) \\ge \\tau \\ \\lor\\ \\text{Ctrl}(u) = \\text{true}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Own</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ctrl</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">true</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Own</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Own}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Own</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是自然人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 经多层股权折算后的有效持股比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是法定阈值（多数法域取 25%），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ctrl</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ctrl}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ctrl</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为通过其他方式取得的实际控制。&quot;穿透&quot;就是沿股权链把每层持股比例相乘回到最终自然人：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i = \\prod_{k=1}^{n} p_{k}^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，多条链的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 加总为&quot;合计有效持股&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审查层</th>\n<th>审查对象</th>\n<th>典型材料</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形式层</td>\n<td>申报主体的法律存在</td>\n<td>注册证、存续证明、章程</td>\n<td>主体不合格，退回补正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形式层</td>\n<td>行业与经营资质</td>\n<td>行业许可、资质证书、业绩</td>\n<td>不符合准入行业，直接否决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实质层</td>\n<td>实益所有人身份</td>\n<td>BO 声明、身份证明、登记册摘录</td>\n<td>无法穿透，暂停审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实质层</td>\n<td>负面清单/制裁命中</td>\n<td>制裁名单、负面清单比对</td>\n<td>命中即升级审查或否决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实质层</td>\n<td>控制权结构真实性</td>\n<td>股权图、代持协议、一致行动安排</td>\n<td>隐匿控制即构成申报不实</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实益所有人的认定标准与阈值\">实益所有人的认定标准与阈值</h2><p>&quot;谁是实益所有人&quot;高度依赖具体法域的定义。全球有两条主流路径——<strong>股权阈值路径</strong>与<strong>控制权路径</strong>——多数法域同时采用，以股权路径为默认、控制权路径为兜底。</p>\n<p>欧盟反洗钱指令框架长期采用 <strong>25% 加一股</strong>的持股或表决权门槛，第五、第六指令强化了登记的公开性与核实义务；对无法识别到自然人的情形，要求登记&quot;高级管理人员&quot;作兜底 BO（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32015L0849\">EUR-Lex 反洗钱指令汇编</a>）。美国《公司透明度法》（CTA）要求报告公司向 FinCEN 申报实益所有人，BO 定义为对报告公司行使<strong>实质性控制</strong>、或持有/控制 <strong>25% 以上</strong>所有权权益的自然人；FinCEN 的 BOI 规则明确了门槛计算方式与&quot;实质性控制&quot;的四指标（高级管理人员、任命权、重大影响决策、其他实质控制）（<a href=\"https://www.fincen.gov/boi\">FinCEN Beneficial Ownership Information Reporting</a>）。</p>\n<p>中国法域下的对应概念是&quot;<strong>实际控制人</strong>&quot;与&quot;<strong>最终受益人</strong>&quot;：自贸区与外商投资准入审查要求穿透识别至最终自然人或国资主体，并核对是否落入负面清单所限领域；人民银行反洗钱规则要求义务机构识别受益所有人，标准同样以&quot;直接或间接拥有超过 25% 股权、表决权&quot;或&quot;通过人事、财务等方式实施控制&quot;为通道（<a href=\"http://www.pbc.gov.cn/\">中国人民银行《金融机构客户尽职调查和客户身份资料及交易记录保存管理办法》</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域/框架</th>\n<th>股权阈值</th>\n<th>控制权兜底</th>\n<th>登记形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FATF Rec.24（国际基准）</td>\n<td>由各国设定，常见 25%</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>集中登记或等效机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟 AMLD</td>\n<td>25% + 一股</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>成员国集中登记，部分公开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国 CTA / FinCEN</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>实质性控制四指标</td>\n<td>向 FinCEN 申报 BOI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国反洗钱规则</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>人事、财务控制</td>\n<td>义务机构尽调留存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自贸区外资准入</td>\n<td>穿透至最终自然人/国资</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>申报 + 审查机构核验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阈值不是装饰：25% 意味着持股 24.9% 的出借人可能完全不进入 BO 清单，这正是股权拆分规避的动机——把控制权拆到多个 24% 的实体名下，隐藏真实控制人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"穿透识别-多层股权-控制权与非股权控制\">穿透识别：多层股权、控制权与非股权控制</h2><p>穿透识别的工程难度随结构深度非线性上升。一条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 层、每层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个股东的股权树，路径数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实际尽调必须剪枝：只追踪达到阈值或有控制特征的路径。识别对象分三类。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类：多层股权链。</strong> 沿&quot;母公司 → 中间控股 → 申报主体&quot;逐层计算有效持股。典型陷阱是<strong>循环持股</strong>（A 持 B、B 持 A）与<strong>交叉持股</strong>，它们使简单乘积失效，需用线性系统求解或迭代收敛逼近稳态权益。跨境结构还常见<strong>多层离岸</strong>（开曼/BVI/香港/新加坡），每层都需独立取得注册文件与股东名册。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类：控制权认定。</strong> 即使持股低于阈值，以下情形仍构成实益所有人：担任董事或高级管理人员、有权任命或罢免多数董事、对重大经营决策有否决权、通过一致行动或代持协议实际支配表决权。<strong>代持（nominee）<strong>最隐蔽——名义股东代他人持股，若不主动穿透，登记册上永远看不到真实控制人；因此&quot;是否存在代持&quot;必须作为</strong>强制问询项</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三类：非股权控制。</strong> 合伙协议的 GP/LP 结构、信托受托人与受益人、基金管理人与投顾、可转债与期权带来的潜在表决权，都影响控制而不体现在持股比例上；境外基金管理人控制的基金持申报主体 30% 时，管理人的实际控制人常即 BO。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[申报主体&lt;br/&gt;自贸区拟入驻企业] --&gt; B{股权链是否穿透&lt;br/&gt;至最终自然人?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[补充注册文件与股东名册&lt;br/&gt;暂停审查]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[计算有效持股 E]&#10;  D --&gt; E{E &gt;= 阈值 25%?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[列入 BO 清单]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G{控制特征?&lt;br/&gt;董监高/任命权/代持/否决权}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| F&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[非 BO,仅记录]&#10;  F --&gt; I[制裁名单/负面清单/PEP 比对]&#10;  I --&gt;|命中| J[升级审查或否决]&#10;  I --&gt;|未命中| K[通过实质层&lt;br/&gt;进入激励核定]&#10;  C --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[申报主体&lt;br/&gt;自贸区拟入驻企业] --&gt; B{股权链是否穿透&lt;br/&gt;至最终自然人?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[补充注册文件与股东名册&lt;br/&gt;暂停审查]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[计算有效持股 E]\n  D --&gt; E{E &gt;= 阈值 25%?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[列入 BO 清单]\n  E --&gt;|否| G{控制特征?&lt;br/&gt;董监高/任命权/代持/否决权}\n  G --&gt;|是| F\n  G --&gt;|否| H[非 BO,仅记录]\n  F --&gt; I[制裁名单/负面清单/PEP 比对]\n  I --&gt;|命中| J[升级审查或否决]\n  I --&gt;|未命中| K[通过实质层&lt;br/&gt;进入激励核定]\n  C --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"负面清单与外资准入的资质门槛\">负面清单与外资准入的资质门槛</h2><p><strong>负面清单</strong>决定&quot;能不能投&quot;。中国自贸区实行《外商投资准入特别管理措施（负面清单）》，对清单内领域设定股比限制、高管要求或禁止投资，2024 年版继续压减条目，制造业限制已基本清零（<a href=\"https://www.ndrc.gov.cn/\">国家发展改革委、商务部《外商投资准入特别管理措施（负面清单）》</a>）。审查逻辑：先由 BO 的国籍/注册地及控制关系判断该投资是否构成&quot;外国投资者投资&quot;，再判断目标行业是否受限，最后核对股比与高管安排。<strong>通过多层离岸结构掩盖真实国籍以规避负面清单，是审查打击的重点</strong>——一旦发现通常构成申报不实，可撤销准入资格并追回已享激励。</p>\n<p><strong>制裁名单</strong>决定&quot;敢不敢收&quot;。OFAC 的 SDN 名单、欧盟合并制裁名单、联合国安理会名单都需按 BO 而非申报主体比对：未受制裁的申报主体若其 BO 在 SDN 名单上，整宗投资即被冻结。这要求穿透结果与名单库做<strong>多字段模糊匹配</strong>（姓名变体、音译、出生日期、证件号）并保留人工复核。</p>\n<p><strong>PEP 名单</strong>决定&quot;要不要加强审查&quot;。PEP 本身不违法，但权力地位带来更高的腐败与洗钱风险，需强化尽职调查（EDD）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-bo-穿透图算法与尽调流水线\">工程实现：BO 穿透图算法与尽调流水线</h2><p>把上述规则落到系统里，核心是三个组件：<strong>股权图数据结构、穿透计算引擎、名单比对服务</strong>。</p>\n<p>股权图用有向图建模：节点是实体与自然人（标注类型、注册地），边是持股关系（标注比例、表决权比例、是否存在代持/质押/一致行动）。穿透计算即在该图上做&quot;从申报主体逆向搜索至自然人&quot;的路径枚举与权益折算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mtext>path </mtext><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i = \\sum_{\\text{path } i} \\prod_{k} p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">path </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。循环持股用阻尼迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^{(t+1)} = P E^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为按比例归一化的转移矩阵）迭代至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|E^{(t+1)} - E^{(t)}\\| &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 得稳态权益分布；实际系统通常设最大穿透层数与路径剪枝阈值。</p>\n<p>名单比对服务封装为独立接口：输入 BO 实体（姓名、出生日期、国籍、证件号），输出命中结果与置信度，内部维护名单版本与更新周期。<strong>把名单比对放在穿透引擎之外</strong>，使名单更新不触发穿透重算，也让穿透结果可复用于准入、KYC 等场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[申报提交&lt;br/&gt;主体+股东名册+BO声明] --&gt; B[结构解析&lt;br/&gt;构建股权图]&#10;  B --&gt; C[穿透计算引擎&lt;br/&gt;路径枚举+权益折算&lt;br/&gt;循环持股迭代收敛]&#10;  C --&gt; D[BO 清单&lt;br/&gt;阈值+控制权双通道]&#10;  D --&gt; E[名单比对服务&lt;br/&gt;制裁/负面清单/PEP]&#10;  D --&gt; F[代持与控制权问询&lt;br/&gt;强制声明+交叉验证]&#10;  E --&gt; G[风险评级]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{风险等级}&#10;  H --&gt;|低| I[常规审批放行]&#10;  H --&gt;|中| J[补充材料/EDD]&#10;  H --&gt;|高| K[升级审查或否决]\">graph TD\n  A[申报提交&lt;br/&gt;主体+股东名册+BO声明] --&gt; B[结构解析&lt;br/&gt;构建股权图]\n  B --&gt; C[穿透计算引擎&lt;br/&gt;路径枚举+权益折算&lt;br/&gt;循环持股迭代收敛]\n  C --&gt; D[BO 清单&lt;br/&gt;阈值+控制权双通道]\n  D --&gt; E[名单比对服务&lt;br/&gt;制裁/负面清单/PEP]\n  D --&gt; F[代持与控制权问询&lt;br/&gt;强制声明+交叉验证]\n  E --&gt; G[风险评级]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{风险等级}\n  H --&gt;|低| I[常规审批放行]\n  H --&gt;|中| J[补充材料/EDD]\n  H --&gt;|高| K[升级审查或否决]</pre><p>尽调流水线的设计要点有三。<strong>一是留痕</strong>：每一次穿透计算、每一版股东名册、每一次名单比对结果都要带版本与时间戳留存，使准入决策日后可重建当时依据。<strong>二是守恒校验</strong>：任一实体层面的持股比例之和必须归一，若股权图&quot;凭空多出&quot;或&quot;少掉&quot;持股，说明数据不完整，应阻断而非静默通过。<strong>三是变更触发</strong>：股东结构变更（增资、股转、代持解除）必须触发<strong>重新穿透</strong>，否则激励可能流向变更后出现的不合格控制人。</p>\n<p>对跨境卖家与投资服务机构而言，实务启示是：<strong>在提交准入申请前主动完成自查穿透</strong>，把最终自然人、控制关系、代持情况整理成可核验的 BO 图谱，既可缩短审查周期，也避免因隐匿结构被判定申报不实而丧失激励资格。结构复杂度本身不违规，<strong>不披露</strong>才违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>准入分两层：形式层查主体的法律与经营资质，实质层查穿透后的实益所有人；只看形式层会被空壳结构绕过。</li>\n<li>BO 认定走&quot;控制 + 利益&quot;双通道：有效持股 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 阈值（多数法域 25%）或通过董监高、任命权、代持、否决权实现实际控制。</li>\n<li>穿透计算是股权图上的路径枚举与权益乘积，需处理循环持股（迭代收敛）；最大穿透层数是必要的工程约束。</li>\n<li>穿透结果必须与三张清单比对：行业负面清单（能否投）、制裁名单（敢不敢收）、PEP 名单（要不要 EDD）。</li>\n<li>工程三组件缺一不可：股权图、穿透计算引擎、名单比对服务；须留痕可追溯、持股守恒校验、结构变更触发重新穿透。</li>\n<li>结构复杂度不违规，不披露才违规。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"投资者资质审查与实益所有人穿透识别","id":"投资者资质审查与实益所有人穿透识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：准入审查的两层结构","id":"核心概念-准入审查的两层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"实益所有人的认定标准与阈值","id":"实益所有人的认定标准与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"穿透识别：多层股权、控制权与非股权控制","id":"穿透识别-多层股权-控制权与非股权控制"},{"level":2,"text":"负面清单与外资准入的资质门槛","id":"负面清单与外资准入的资质门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：BO 穿透图算法与尽调流水线","id":"工程实现-bo-穿透图算法与尽调流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"外商投资准入负面清单与准入前国民待遇机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/zone-regime-investor-admission-model/foreign-investment-negative-list-access"},"next":{"title":"激励政策分类与可计算规则模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/incentive-policy-taxonomy-rule-model"}}